                            "type": "string",
                            "description": "Optional. For a task or event only: a short plain label (at most 8 words) that reads well as a list item, e.g. \"Order the soil\". Omit when the quote already reads that way, and omit for facts and questions. It is kept only if at least half of its content words (words of four letters or more, matched on their first four letters) come from the quote; otherwise it is dropped, not repaired, and the quote becomes the item's label. At most 80 characters on one line; a title with no such words is kept."
                        },
